{"id":"t01-a4cec8","status":"read","groups":[{"levels":[[{"surface":"محمد بن إسحاق المسيبي","kind":"narrator"}],[{"surface":"أنس","kind":"narrator"}],[{"surface":"موسى بن عقبة","kind":"narrator"}]]},{"levels":[[{"surface":"سويد بن سعيد","kind":"narrator"}],[{"surface":"حفص بن ميسرة","kind":"narrator"}],[{"surface":"موسى بن عقبة","kind":"narrator"}]]},{"levels":[[{"surface":"أبو بكر بن أبي شيبة","kind":"narrator"}],[{"surface":"أبو خالد الأحمر","kind":"narrator"},{"surface":"عيسى بن يونس","kind":"narrator"}],[{"surface":"ابن عون","kind":"narrator"}]]},{"levels":[[{"surface":"عبد، الله بن جعفر بن يحيى","kind":"narrator"}],[{"surface":"معن","kind":"narrator"}],[{"surface":"مالك","kind":"narrator"}]]},{"levels":[[{"surface":"أبو نصر التمار","kind":"narrator"}],[{"surface":"حماد، بن سلمة","kind":"narrator"}],[{"surface":"أيوب","kind":"narrator"}]]},{"levels":[[{"surface":"الحلواني","kind":"narrator"},{"surface":"عبد بن حميد","kind":"narrator"}],[{"surface":"يعقوب بن إبراهيم بن سعد","kind":"narrator"}],[{"surface":"أبي","kind":"relation"}],[{"surface":"صالح","kind":"narrator"}]]},{"levels":[[{"surface":"عبيد الله","kind":"narrator"}],[{"surface":"نافع","kind":"narrator","occurrence":2}]],"variant":true}],"shared_tail":[[{"surface":"نافع","kind":"narrator","occurrence":1}],[{"surface":"ابن عمر","kind":"narrator"}]],"needs_ruling":false,"notes":["Six «ح»-joined branches. «كلاهما عن موسى بن عقبة» closes the first two branches on Musa; «كل هؤلاء عن نافع، عن ابن عمر» is written once after the last «ح», so it is the shared tail.","«بمعنى حديث عبيد الله عن نافع» names another transmitter of the same saying: variant group. «غير أن في حديث موسى بن عقبة وصالح» is a wording difference and is left out. Editor glosses («يعني ابن عياض», «يعني ابن مهدي») are left out."],"fixes":[]}